.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Finsupp/Single.lean:/-! ### Declarations about `erase` -/
.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Finsupp/Single.lean:`erase a f` is the finitely supported function equal to `f` except at `a` where it is equal to `0`.
.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Finsupp/Single.lean:If `a` is not in the support of `f` then `erase a f = f`.
